<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<FindBugsFilter>
    <!--
      EI_EXPOSE_REP / EI_EXPOSE_REP2 excluded for exactly five classes of the
      v2-shortener-service "shortlink" package (Day 2, Task #9). Nothing else is excluded:
      every other SpotBugs pattern, in every other class of every module, still fails the build.

      Two distinct groups, neither of which is a real defect here:

      1. CachedShortLink and CreateUrlRequest are records whose "redirectRules" component is
         deserialized by Jackson (from a Redis entry, or from an HTTP request body) into a
         mutable ArrayList. Both DO defensively copy it (List.copyOf) in a compact constructor,
         which is the correct fix and is kept regardless of this file; the analysis still cannot
         prove immutability through a record's auto generated canonical accessor, which returns
         the field itself and cannot be replaced without giving up what makes it a record.

      2. ShortLinkCache, ShortLinkService and ShortLinkController each store a constructor
         injected Spring collaborator: an ObjectMapper, a StringRedisTemplate/RedisOperations,
         or one of this project's own beans. That is ordinary dependency injection, not caller
         owned state that defensive copying would protect. The check is transitive, so it
         propagates: ShortLinkCache holds a live ObjectMapper and a live Redis client (both
         unavoidably mutable, stateful framework objects with no immutable variant to switch to,
         and "copying" either would defeat the point of injecting them), so ShortLinkCache can
         never be proven immutable, nor can ShortLinkService which holds one, nor
         ShortLinkController which holds that.

      Worth contrasting with two real fixes this project made instead of excluding: PR #20
      switched a RabbitTemplate field to the AmqpTemplate interface, and ReservedSlugs (also a
      constructor injected concrete class, in this same package) is NOT flagged at all because
      it is genuinely immutable, holding one unmodifiable Set. Where a real fix exists, it was
      applied; this file covers only the cases where none does. See AI_USAGE_LOG.md.
    -->
    <Match>
        <Or>
            <Class name="com.artmendez.urlshortener.v2.shortlink.cache.CachedShortLink"/>
            <Class name="com.artmendez.urlshortener.v2.shortlink.cache.ShortLinkCache"/>
            <Class name="com.artmendez.urlshortener.v2.shortlink.service.ShortLinkService"/>
            <Class name="com.artmendez.urlshortener.v2.shortlink.web.CreateUrlRequest"/>
            <Class name="com.artmendez.urlshortener.v2.shortlink.web.ShortLinkController"/>
        </Or>
        <Bug pattern="EI_EXPOSE_REP,EI_EXPOSE_REP2"/>
    </Match>
</FindBugsFilter>
